{"duration": 32.979, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A young carpenter slathers tar on a brand\u2011new hull, his hands trembling.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.898}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His mates snicker, saying the black paint is just for looks.", "start": 4.318, "end": 7.346}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Weeks later, the ship drifts slower, its wake thick with slime.", "start": 7.766, "end": 10.83}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The crew grumbles as the voyage takes longer than promised.", "start": 11.05, "end": 14.134}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like trying to run in a wet sweater \u2013 the extra drag hurts.", "start": 14.554, "end": 17.931}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The black mixture of tar and pitch actually seals the wood, hiding barnacles and algae.", "start": 18.351, "end": 22.82}, {"beat": 4, "text": "By hiding biofouling, the hull stays smooth and the ship keeps its speed.", "start": 23.04, "end": 26.878}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, the very darkness that made the ships look menacing was a simple speed hack.", "start": 27.298, "end": 31.859}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.195, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "young", "start": 0.245, "end": 0.42, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "carpenter", "start": 0.47, "end": 0.945, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "slathers", "start": 1.02, "end": 1.445, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "tar", "start": 1.495, "end": 1.77, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "on", "start": 1.795, "end": 1.87, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.895, "end": 1.92, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "brand\u2011new", "start": 1.97, "end": 2.345, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hull,", "start": 2.395, "end": 2.895, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 2.945, "end": 3.07, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hands", "start": 3.12, "end": 3.37, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "trembling.", "start": 3.42, "end": 3.941, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "His", "start": 4.383, "end": 4.533, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "mates", "st